{"id":"n15925-1-7","stage":2,"title":"맡다 · 闻","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15925-1-7-1","ko":"이 꽃에서 향기가 나니?","zh":"这朵花有香味吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽃에서","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"향기가","meaning":"香气，香味","explanation":"향기：香气，香味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"향기","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72483","senseId":"1","lemma":"향기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나니?","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"913f16597fe350c3","term":"향기","zh":"香气，香味","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3","entryId":"72483","definition":"好闻的味道。","pronunciation":["향기"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/778b234f4152e4cb9267.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15925-1-7-2","ko":"잠깐만. 한번 냄새를 맡아 볼게.","zh":"稍等一下，我闻闻看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词