4a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b212b398de123ae3f18.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15925","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.3644,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["稍等一下，我闻闻看。","这朵花有香味吗？","看那边，大楼之间出现了一道彩虹。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这朵花有香味吗？","看那边，大楼之间出现了一道彩虹。","稍等一下，我闻闻看。"],"answer":2}]}
